## iso_stdio_wide_specifiers with legacy_stdio_float_rounding: no printf or
## scanf bit is left (printf 0x24 less 0x20 and 0x4, scanf 0x2 less 0x2), in
## either order. legacy_stdio_wide_specifiers with it leaves the float
## rounding bits (printf 0x4, scanf 0x2).
