# LTO-MAP-DAG: {{^ *}}DefinedFunction{{[[:space:]]+}}{{Global|Weak}}{{[[:space:]]+}}lto.exe.lto.o{{[[:space:]]+}}__local_stdio_printf_options{{$}}
# LTO-MAP-DAG: {{^ *}}DefinedFunction{{[[:space:]]+}}{{Global|Weak}}{{[[:space:]]+}}lto.exe.lto.o{{[[:space:]]+}}__local_stdio_scanf_options{{$}}
# LTO-MAP:     {{^}}Methods:{{$}}
