# RUN: %{opts} lto.txt | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=LTO-OPTS
# LTO-OPTS-DAG: {{^}}options __local_stdio_printf_options |= 0x24{{$}}
# LTO-OPTS-DAG: {{^}}options __local_stdio_scanf_options |= 0x2{{$}}
## The initializer's call and the helper's call of each: the options word
## is read at run time, not folded to the zero it starts with.
